ories reverting to the Crown, enhancing royal authority."}, {"sourceSlug": "reconquista", "sourceName": "Reconquista", "verb": "FRAMES", "targetSlug": "nuo-snchez", "targetName": "Nuño Sánchez", "context": "The broader historical context of the Reconquista provided the framework for Nuño Sánchez's military and political career in the Crown of Aragon."}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-08T08:18:28Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#31248011958", "field": "detailsJson.places", "oldValue": [{"name": "http://www.wikidata.org/.well-known/genid/a6785c9be4eb813dee89f0d354e84014", "role": "Birth place"}], "newValue": [{"name": "Palma, Majorca", "role": "Conquest site, Governorship"}, {"name": "Roussillon, France", "role": "County held"}, {"name": "Valencia, Spain", "role": "Conquest participation"}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-08T08:18:28Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#31248011958", "field": "subjects", "oldValue": ["Military Leaders & Commanders"], "newValue": ["Crown of Aragon", "Medieval Nobility", "Reconquista", "Military History", "Catalonia", "Majorca", "Feudalism", "Spanish History", "Regency", "Statesmanship"]}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-08T08:18:28Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#31248011958", "field": "frameworks", "oldValue": ["CONFLICT_AND_RESOLUTION", "GEOPOLITICAL_LINKAGE", "TEMPORAL_LINKAGE"], "newValue": ["DIPLOMATIC_HISTORY", "STRUCTURAL_ANALYSIS", "CAUSE_AND_EFFECT"]}], "_unsyncedEdits": true}
